---
source: tests/cli/invariants.rs
expression: help(args)
---
Print or install shell completions

Usage: work completions [OPTIONS] [SHELL]

Arguments:
  [SHELL]
          Shell (default: detected from $SHELL)

          Possible values:
          - bash: GNU bash
          - zsh:  zsh
          - fish: fish

Options:
      --install
          Write the script to the shell's completion directory

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
